<div class="example"><h4>Example</h4><p>After a hurricane, the price of plywood jumps. That signal tells suppliers in other states that plywood is badly needed (signal), rewards them for trucking it in (incentive), and pushes buyers to purchase only what they truly need (rationing).</p></div>
